Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

diff --git a/src/sdk/moho/editor/EdStrata.cpp b/src/sdk/moho/editor/EdStrata.cpp
index c3c0ee2..5d9021d 100644
--- a/src/sdk/moho/editor/EdStrata.cpp
